# RECEIVED-VALUE-NOT-AN-EXPRESSION (steps/defects.md): `x: 1 + 2 3` is the
# value 1 + 2 followed by a neighbouring 3: not one value. A fix that keeps
# `1 + 2` and drops `3`, or that only counts two fields, stays red here.
int: x 1
x: 1 + 2 3
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: x; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
